{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Keep deeply nested records isolated between exporter lanes.** This recursive `deepcopy` raises for sufficiently deep built-in containers, after which `_export_one` passes the original canonical record to every lane. Concurrent exporters can then mutate or normalize the same object, producing timing-dependent or corrupted output. Clone built-in containers iteratively while preserving aliases and cycles, and add a two-lane deep-record test where one exporter mutates its input.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7tfUvC","finding_digest":"ef105dba4c70788de01bfc03a6949e25abbd5f2f75bdbf937f8fd783dc421ea4","finding_id":"arf_v1_54if3osmob4i3ya37qb2nfe6ew","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_copy_record_containers::recursive-container-copy","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_copy_record_containers::recursive-container-copy","line":53,"observation_digest":"45c45179e3cdacdd1ab2138c485dd56f5ae07de59111eef9ff5ff56b45a585f4","observation_id":"aro_v1_ixcfc6pdzwwn2gvscogeqxovn5","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_54if3osmob4i3ya37qb2nfe6ew","published_at":"2026-09-10T23:31:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_7o5junual2x2e5ekjiaagtsrrc","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"afc10fe129032aa3f2496bcbea3af41b17fe11bd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":53,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_xgnrrqkp7k6noipnind5za2blk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T23:31:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
